    },
    "On macOS 15, xlinuxfs cannot check whether lklfuse is enabled. If it is already on, you can dismiss this tip." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 15 上，xlinuxfs 无法检测 lklfuse 的开关状态。如果已经开启，可以关闭此提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On this macOS a sandboxed app can't run mount for you. Paste this into Terminal:" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在此版本 macOS 上,沙盒应用无法替你执行 mount。请把下面的命令粘贴到“终端”运行:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once attached, the volume appears in the list and mounts automatically." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "附加后,该卷会出现在列表中并自动挂载。"
